CC         Note=Only produced by allele A*1103;
CC   -!- POLYMORPHISM: The following alleles of A-11 are known: A*1101 (A-
CC       11E), A*1102 (A-11K), A*1103, A*1104, A*1105 and A*1107. The
CC       sequence shown is that of A*1101.
