CC       (A*24YM) and A*2414 (A*24SA). Allele A*2402 is represented in all
CC       major racial groups. Allele A*2406 and allele A*2413 are found in
CC       the Australian Aborigenal population. Allele A*2414 is found in
CC       individuals of South American descent. The sequence shown is that
CC       of A*2402.
