CC   -!- FUNCTION: Involved in the presentation of foreign antigens to the
CC       immune system.
CC   -!- SUBUNIT: Heterodimer of an alpha chain and a beta chain (beta-2-
CC       microglobulin).
CC   -!- SUBCELLULAR LOCATION: Type I membrane protein.
CC   -!- POLYMORPHISM: The following alleles of B-27 are known:
CC       B*2701=B*2705, B*2702 (B27.2; B-27k; B27e), B*2703 (B27d), B*2704,
CC       B*2706, B*2707, B*2708 (B7Qui) and B*2709 (B27-ci). The sequence
CC       shown is that of B*2701.
CC   -!- DISEASE: HLA-B27 is associated with the development of ankylosing
CC       spondylitis.
