CC   -!- FUNCTION: Involved in the presentation of foreign antigens to the
CC       immune system.
CC   -!- SUBUNIT: Heterodimer of an alpha chain and a beta chain (beta-2-
CC       microglobulin).
CC   -!- SUBCELLULAR LOCATION: Type I membrane protein.
CC   -!- POLYMORPHISM: The following alleles of B-35 are known: B*3501,
CC       B*3502, B*3503, B*3504, B*3505 (B35-G), B*3506 (B35-K), B*3507,
CC       B*3508, B*3525, B*3528, B*3529 (B*KG), B*3530, B*3532 (B*TMUL) and
CC       B*3536. The sequence shown is that of B*3501.
