CC   -!- FUNCTION: Involved in the presentation of foreign antigens to the
CC       immune system.
CC   -!- SUBUNIT: Heterodimer of an alpha chain and a beta chain (beta-2-
CC       microglobulin).
CC   -!- SUBCELLULAR LOCATION: Type I membrane protein.
CC   -!- POLYMORPHISM: The following alleles of B-39 are known: B*3901
CC       (B39.1), B*3902 (B9.2), B*3903, B*3904 (B39N), B*3905 (ST-16),
CC       B*3906 (B39G), B*3907 (B39uw3), B*3909, B*3910, B*3912 (B3901v),
CC       B*3923 (B39022v1) and B*3924. The sequence shown is that of
CC       B*3901.
