DE   5-hydroxytryptamine 2 receptor (5-HTB2) (Serotonin receptor 2).
GN   Name=5HTB2;
OS   Aplysia californica (California sea hare).
OC   Eukaryota; Metazoa; Mollusca; Gastropoda; Orthogastropoda;
OC   Apogastropoda; Heterobranchia; Euthyneura; Opisthobranchia; Anaspidea;
