CC   -!- CATALYTIC ACTIVITY: S-adenosyl-L-methionine + 7-hydroxyisoflavone
CC       = S-adenosyl-L-homocysteine + 7-methoxyisoflavone.
CC   -!- PATHWAY: Medicarpin synthesis.
CC   -!- SUBUNIT: Homodomer.
CC   -!- SIMILARITY: Belongs to the methyltransferase superfamily.
