DE   (Plasma membrane adaptor HA2/AP2 adaptin beta subunit) (Clathrin
DE   assembly protein complex 2 beta large chain) (AP105B) (Fragment).
GN   Name=AP2B1; Synonyms=CLAPB1;
OS   Bos taurus (Bovine).
OC   Eukaryota; Metazoa; Chordata; Craniata; Vertebrata; Euteleostomi;
