CC       lesser extent, uptake of L-alanine and L-glutamate.
CC   -!- SUBCELLULAR LOCATION: Integral membrane protein.
CC   -!- TISSUE SPECIFICITY: Highly expressed in adipose tissue, lower
CC       levels seen in lung. Not expressed in brain, kidney, liver or
CC       heart and only traces are detected in spleen, thymus and skeletal
CC       muscle.
CC   -!- DEVELOPMENTAL STAGE: Expressed is induced during differentiation
CC       of preadipocytes into adipocytes.
CC   -!- SIMILARITY: Belongs to the sodium:dicarboxylate (SDF) symporter
CC       (TC 2.A.23) family.
