CC   -!- FUNCTION: Catalyzes the hydrolysis of the palmitoyl moiety of the
CC       antifungal antibiotic, aculeacin A, giving a hexapeptide moiety
CC       and a long chain fatty acid.
CC   -!- SUBUNIT: Dimer of two non-identical chains processed from the same
CC       precursor.
CC   -!- SIMILARITY: Belongs to the penicillin acylase family.
