CC         Note=No experimental confirmation available;
CC   -!- TISSUE SPECIFICITY: Expressed at particularly high levels in fetal
CC       liver, and erythroid tissues of embryos and adults. Found also in
CC       adult bone marrow, liver and kidney, and at lower levels in heart,
CC       brain and spleen.
CC   -!- DEVELOPMENTAL STAGE: Abundant in the liver but not in non-
CC       hematopoietic tissues of E13 embryos.
CC   -!- INDUCTION: By transcription factor GATA-1 during erythroid
CC       differentiation and in vitro, by DMSO during terminal erythroid
CC       maturation.
CC   -!- SIMILARITY: Belongs to the ABC transporter family. MDR subfamily.
