CC   -!- FUNCTION: Lacks cytidine deaminase activity, at least on RNA
CC       molecules (monomeric nucleoside substrates or synthetic apoB RNA
CC       template). Unable to reduce HIV-1 infectivity in vitro.
CC   -!- COFACTOR: Zinc (By similarity).
CC   -!- TISSUE SPECIFICITY: Expressed in peripherical leukocytes and
CC       keratinocytes.
CC   -!- MISCELLANEOUS: It is one of seven related genes or pseudogenes
CC       found in a cluster, thought to result from gene duplication, on
CC       chromosome 22.
CC   -!- SIMILARITY: Belongs to the cytidine and deoxycytidylate deaminase
CC       family.
