CC   -!- TISSUE SPECIFICITY: Widely expressed with highest expression in
CC       brain.
CC   -!- DOMAIN: The t-SNARE coiled-coil homology domain is necessary and
CC       sufficient for interaction with STX1A (By similarity).
CC   -!- PTM: In vitro substrate for v-Abl (By similarity). Phosphorylated
CC       on tyrosine residues after serum stimulation or induction by v-
CC       Abl.
CC   -!- DISEASE: Involved in acute leukemias through a chromosomal
CC       translocation t(10;11)(p11.2;q23) that involves ABI1 and MLL. ABI1
CC       isoform 2 was found to be present in acute leukemia MLL-ABI1
CC       fusion transcript.
CC   -!- SIMILARITY: Contains 1 SH3 domain.
CC   -!- SIMILARITY: Contains 1 t-SNARE coiled-coil homology domain.
