CC   -!- SUBUNIT: Interacts with ABL1 and ABL2.
CC   -!- SUBCELLULAR LOCATION: Cytoplasmic. Isoform 1 but not isoform 3 is
CC       localized to protruding lamellipodia and filopodia tips (By
CC       similarity).
