CC   -!- FUNCTION: May inhibit tumor metastasis (By similarity). In vitro,
CC       reduces cell motility.
CC   -!- SUBUNIT: May interact with PAK1 and PAK2. Probably interacts with
CC       TARSH.
CC   -!- SUBCELLULAR LOCATION: Cytoplasmic. Colocalizes with PAK2 at
CC       leading edge of cells.
CC   -!- TISSUE SPECIFICITY: Expressed in heart, lung, liver, pancreas,
CC       kidney, placenta and at low levels in brain and skeletal muscle.
CC   -!- SIMILARITY: Contains 1 SH3 domain.
