CC       similarity).
CC   -!- SUBUNIT: Homodimer; disulfide-linked (By similarity).
CC   -!- SUBCELLULAR LOCATION: Extracellular (By similarity).
CC   -!- PTM: Topaquinone (TPQ) is generated by copper-dependent
CC       autoxidation of a specific tyrosyl residue (By similarity).
CC   -!- SIMILARITY: Belongs to the copper/topaquinone oxidase family.
