CC         IsoId=Q09429-1; Sequence=Displayed;
CC       Name=B;
CC         IsoId=Q09429-2; Sequence=VSP_000057;
CC       Name=C;
CC         IsoId=Q09429-3; Sequence=VSP_000056;
CC   -!- SIMILARITY: Belongs to the ABC transporter family. MRP subfamily.
