RL   J. Biol. Chem. 271:24321-24324(1996).
RN   [2]
RP   SEQUENCE FROM N.A. (ISOFORMS SUR2A AND SUR2C).
RX   MEDLINE=96424461; PubMed=8826984;
RA   Chutkow W.A., Simon M.C., Le Beau M.M., Burant C.F.;
