CC   -!- FUNCTION: May play an important role in carbon flux control.
CC   -!- CATALYTIC ACTIVITY: Isocitrate = succinate + glyoxylate.
CC   -!- COFACTOR: Requires divalent cations, magnesium, manganese and
CC       cobalt can be used.
CC   -!- ENZYME REGULATION: Inhibited by 3-phosphoglycerate, 6-
