CC   -!- SUBCELLULAR LOCATION: Cytoplasmic.
CC   -!- MISCELLANEOUS: Shows maximal activity at 40 degrees Celsius. The
CC       pH optimum is 7.3.
CC   -!- SIMILARITY: Belongs to the isocitrate lyase family.
