CC   -!- TISSUE SPECIFICITY: Spermatocytes, adult testis.
CC   -!- INDUCTION: Expression is thought to be subject to hormonal
CC       regulation by androgens.
CC   -!- SIMILARITY: Belongs to peptidase family M2.
