CC       Name=Long;
CC         IsoId=P12392-2; Sequence=VSP_000076;
CC   -!- TISSUE SPECIFICITY: In the brain, it is detected in the medial
CC       habenula. In the peripheral nervous system, it is found at least
CC       in the adrenal gland.
CC   -!- SIMILARITY: Belongs to the ligand-gated ionic channel (TC 1.A.9)
CC       family.
