CC   -!- FUNCTION: AcpA and acpB regulate cap gene expression and capsule
CC       synthesis.
CC   -!- INDUCTION: Transcriptionally regulated by atxA. Transcription is
CC       also positively controlled by carbonic acid and CO(2).
CC   -!- MISCELLANEOUS: AcpA has a larger effect on cap gene expression
CC       than does acpB.
CC   -!- SIMILARITY: Belongs to the atxA/acpA family.
