CC   -!- FUNCTION: Carrier of the growing fatty acid chain in fatty acid
CC       biosynthesis. Is involved in the transfer of long hydroxylated
CC       fatty acids to lipid A. Is acylated predominantly with 27-
CC       hydroxyoctacosanoic acid.
