CC       3 AMP + 3 diphosphate.
CC   -!- COFACTOR: Contains 3 covalently bound phosphopantetheines
CC       (Potential).
CC   -!- PATHWAY: Biosynthesis of penicillin and cephalosporin; first step.
CC   -!- SIMILARITY: Belongs to the ATP-dependent AMP-binding enzyme
CC       family.
