CC   -!- FUNCTION: Controls the proteolytic processing of Notch and
CC       mediates lateral inhibition during neurogenesis (By similarity).
CC   -!- CATALYTIC ACTIVITY: Endopeptidase of broad specificity.
CC   -!- COFACTOR: Binds 1 zinc ion (By similarity).
CC   -!- SUBCELLULAR LOCATION: Type I membrane protein.
CC   -!- DEVELOPMENTAL STAGE: Expressed maternally throughout the embryo
CC       and then becomes restricted to a pan-neural expression pattern.
CC   -!- PTM: The precursor is cleaved by a furin endopeptidase (By
CC       similarity).
CC   -!- SIMILARITY: Belongs to peptidase family M12B.
CC   -!- SIMILARITY: Contains 1 disintegrin domain.
