CC       and energy (By similarity).
CC   -!- CATALYTIC ACTIVITY: Acetyl-CoA + [acetyl-CoA
CC       decarbonylase/synthase complex beta subunit] = CoA + acetyl-
CC       [acetyl-CoA decarbonylase/synthase complex beta subunit].
