CC   -!- SUBUNIT: Monomer. The ACDS complex is made up of alpha, epsilon,
CC       beta, gamma and delta chains with a probable stoichiometry of
CC       (alpha(2)epsilon(2))(4)-beta(8)-(gamma(1)delta(1))(8) (Potential).
CC   -!- SIMILARITY: Belongs to the cdhC family.
