CC   -!- FUNCTION: The enzyme complex may have a wide variety of catalytic
CC       activities including ATP-dependent exonuclease, ATP-stimulated
CC       endonuclease, ATP-dependent helicase and DNA-dependent ATPase
CC       activities. The subunit A may have a role in DNA unwinding
CC       (helicase), and in the nuclease activity (By similarity).
CC   -!- SUBUNIT: The B.subtilis ATP-dependent nuclease complex is formed
CC       by one B subunit in conjunction with one A subunit.
