CC       probable stoichiometry of (alpha(2)epsilon(2))(4)-beta(8)-
CC       (gamma(1)delta(1))(8) (Potential).
CC   -!- SIMILARITY: The iron-sulfur centers are similar to those of
CC       bacterial-type 4Fe-4S ferredoxins.
