CC       regulators of gastrointestinal, cardiovascular bioactivities
CC       mediated by the CALCRL/RAMPs receptor complexes. Activates the
CC       cAMP-dependent pathway.
CC   -!- SUBCELLULAR LOCATION: Secreted.
CC   -!- TISSUE SPECIFICITY: High expression detected in the submaxillary
CC       gland, kidney, stomach, and mesentery, followed by the pituitary,
CC       lung, pancreas, intestines, spleen, thymus and ovary. Expressed
CC       mainly in the intermediate lobe of the pituitary, with sporadic in
CC       the anterior lobe.
CC   -!- SIMILARITY: Belongs to the adrenomedullin family.
