CC   -!- FUNCTION: Receptor for adrenomedullin. The activity of this
CC       receptor is mediated by G proteins which activate adenylate
CC       cyclase (By similarity).
CC   -!- SUBCELLULAR LOCATION: Integral membrane protein.
CC   -!- TISSUE SPECIFICITY: Highly expressed in heart, skeletal muscle,
CC       immune system, adrenal gland and liver.
CC   -!- SIMILARITY: Belongs to family 1 of G-protein coupled receptors.
