CC   -!- SUBCELLULAR LOCATION: Mitochondrial.
CC   -!- SIMILARITY: In the N-terminal section; belongs to the AAA ATPase
CC       family.
CC   -!- SIMILARITY: In the C-terminal section; belongs to peptidase family
CC       M41.
