CC   -!- FUNCTION: Phosphatidylinositol 3-kinase homolog that regulates
CC       longevity and diapause. Could function in the development or
CC       neuroendocrine signalling of the dauer pathway.
CC   -!- CATALYTIC ACTIVITY: ATP + 1-phosphatidyl-1D-myo-inositol = ADP +
CC       1-phosphatidyl-1D-myo-inositol 3-phosphate.
CC   -!- DEVELOPMENTAL STAGE: Expressed both maternally and zygotically.
CC   -!- SIMILARITY: Belongs to the PI3/PI4-kinase family.
