CC   -!- FUNCTION: Broad substrate range permease which transports
CC       asparagine and glutamine with intermediate specificity. Also
CC       transports Ala, Cys, Gly, Ser, Thr, Cys, Met, Phe, Tyr, Ile, Leu
CC       and Val.
CC   -!- SUBCELLULAR LOCATION: Integral membrane protein (Probable).
CC   -!- SIMILARITY: Belongs to the amino acid-polyamine-organocation (APC)
CC       superfamily. YAT (TC 2.A.3.10) family.
