CC   -!- FUNCTION: Targets the cAMP-dependent protein kinase (PKA) to the
CC       plasma membrane, and permits functional coupling to the L-type
CC       calcium channel.
CC   -!- SUBUNIT: Binds cAMP-dependent protein kinase (PKA).
CC   -!- SUBCELLULAR LOCATION: Membrane-anchored. The alpha isoform is
CC       targeted predominantly to the lateral membrane while the beta
CC       isoform is targeted predominantly to the apical membrane.
CC   -!- ALTERNATIVE PRODUCTS:
CC       Event=Alternative splicing; Named isoforms=3;
