CC   -!- FUNCTION: Required for bipolar spindle formation and proper
CC       chromosome segregation. Has a role in connecting the kinetochores
CC       and the plus end of pole to chromosome microtubules. Also required
CC       for the activation of the spindle checkpoint pathway.
CC   -!- SUBCELLULAR LOCATION: Spindle pole body and the periphery of the
CC       kinetochores.
CC   -!- SIMILARITY: Belongs to the TOG/XMAP215 family.
CC   -!- SIMILARITY: Contains 2 HEAT repeats.
