CC   -!- FUNCTION: Required for the insertion of some light harvesting
CC       chlorophyll-binding proteins (LHCP) into the chloroplast thylakoid
CC       membrane. Required for the insertion of LHCB1, LHCB4.1 and LHCB5
CC       proteins into thylakoid membrane, while it is not required for
CC       insertion of proteins psbX, psbW and psbY.
CC   -!- SUBUNIT: Forms a complex with CPFTSY and the signal recognition
CC       particle (cpSRP).
CC   -!- SUBCELLULAR LOCATION: Integral membrane protein. Chloroplast;
CC       localized to thylakoid membrane.
