CC   -!- FUNCTION: Involved in the production of the bacteriocin
CC       subtilosin. Required for maximal production and for optimal
CC       immunity to subtilosin.
CC   -!- SUBCELLULAR LOCATION: Integral membrane protein (Potential).
CC   -!- INDUCTION: Transcription is highly induced by oxygen limitation
CC       and is under dual and independent control of spo0A-abrB and resDE.
