CC   -!- FUNCTION: Required for the initiation of lateral roots independent
CC       from auxin signaling. May function in maintaining the pericycle in
CC       the mitotically competent state needed for lateral root formation.
CC   -!- SUBCELLULAR LOCATION: Nuclear.
CC   -!- ALTERNATIVE PRODUCTS:
