CC         IsoId=Q84VX3-3; Sequence=VSP_009628;
CC         Note=No experimental confirmation available;
CC   -!- TISSUE SPECIFICITY: Widely expressed. Expressed throughout the
CC       root tip, stele and lateral primordia. Also expressed in the
CC       shoots.
CC   -!- CAUTION: Ref.2 sequence differs from that shown due to erroneous
CC       gene model prediction.
