CC   -!- FUNCTION: Member of the two-component regulatory system algB/kinB
CC       involved in regulation of alginate biosynthesis genes. Positive
CC       regulator of the alginate biosynthetic gene algD.
CC   -!- PATHWAY: Alginate biosynthesis; regulation.
CC   -!- PTM: Phosphorylated by kinB.
CC   -!- MISCELLANEOUS: In vivo phosphorylation of algB is not required for
CC       its role in alginate production. The mechanism by which it
CC       activates algD appears not to be mediated by conventional
CC       phosphorylation-dependent signal transduction.
CC   -!- SIMILARITY: Contains 1 response regulatory domain.
CC   -!- SIMILARITY: Contains 1 sigma-54 factor interaction ATP-binding
CC       domain.
