CC   -!- CATALYTIC ACTIVITY: 2-dehydro-3-deoxy-D-gluconate 6-phosphate =
CC       pyruvate + D-glyceraldehyde 3-phosphate.
CC   -!- PATHWAY: Key enzyme in the Entner-Doudoroff pathway.
CC   -!- PATHWAY: Participates in the regulation of the intracellular level
CC       of glyoxylate.
CC   -!- SUBUNIT: Homotrimer.
CC   -!- SUBCELLULAR LOCATION: Cytoplasmic.
CC   -!- INDUCTION: Constitutive, three-fold induction occurs for growth on
CC       gluconate and two-fold for growth on hexuronic acids.
CC   -!- MISCELLANEOUS: It also catalyzes the beta-decarboxylation of
CC       oxaloacetate.
CC   -!- SIMILARITY: Belongs to the KHG/KDPG aldolase family.
