CC   -!- TISSUE SPECIFICITY: Expressed in liver and in sublingual and
CC       submaxillary salivary glands. Highly concentrated in secretory
CC       fluid such as saliva and urine as well as in hair dandruff
CC       extract.
CC   -!- PTM: Several N-terminal ends may be due to cleavage by signal
CC       peptidase at different sites or may be generated by proteolytic
CC       processing of the secreted protein.
CC   -!- PTM: Analysis of the sugar composition shows the presence of
CC       GalNAc, Gal, NeuAc, GlcNAc, and Man. May be also O-glycosylated.
