CC   -!- FUNCTION: Specific receptor for the autocrine motility factor.
CC       Possesses ubiquitin ligase activity and can target both itself and
CC       other proteins including CD3D and APOB for proteasomal
CC       degradation. Mediates tumor invasion and metastasis.
CC   -!- SUBUNIT: Interacts with UBE2G2/UBC7 through a region distinct from
CC       the RING finger.
CC   -!- SUBCELLULAR LOCATION: Integral membrane protein. Endoplasmic
CC       reticulum.
