RA   Kalantry S., Manning S., Haub O., Tomihara-Newberger C., Lee H.-G.,
RA   Fangman J., Disteche C.M., Manova K., Lacy E.;
RT   "The amnionless gene, essential for mouse gastrulation, encodes a
