DE   aminopeptidase) (LAP) (Leucyl aminopeptidase) (Proline aminopeptidase)
DE   (EC 3.4.11.5) (Prolyl aminopeptidase).
GN   Name=LAPA2;
OS   Lycopersicon esculentum (Tomato).
